  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ジムオブカントーで　もらえる\nノベルティの　バッジ。　どこかの\nジムバッジを　まねているらしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "체육관오브관동에서 받을 수 있는\n노벨티 배지. 어딘가의\n체육관 배지를 흉내 낸듯하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可在關都之道館獲得的徽章贈品。\n聽說這好像是在模仿\n某個地方的道館徽章。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un badge promotionnel que vous avez obtenu\nà l’Arène de Kanto. Il paraît que c’est une imitation\ndu Badge d’une certaine Arène.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Werbegeschenk, das man in der Kanto-Arena\nerhält. Es scheint sich dabei um die Nachbildung\neines Ordens einer bestimmten Arena zu handeln.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Medalla conseguida en el Gimnasio de Kanto. Su\naspecto guarda un sospechoso parecido con la\nmedalla de otro Gimnasio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Medaglia souvenir ottenuta alla Palestra di Kanto.\nSembra ispirata alla Medaglia di un’altra Palestra.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A novelty badge that you can receive at the\nKantonian Gym. Rumor has it that it imitates\nthe Badge of a Gym somewhere.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
